judgment.rationale:
The only available evidence collector — getModelCard — returned null, indicating that no model card exists for "churn-predictor-v1" / "churn-predictor-endpoint". 

SP 800-53 Rev 5 RA-3 requires, at minimum:
- (a) A conducted risk assessment identifying threats, vulnerabilities, likelihood/magnitude of harm, and PII-related adverse effects;
- (c) Documentation of risk assessment results in a security/privacy plan, risk assessment report, or equivalent artifact;
- (d) Periodic review of risk assessment results;
- (e) Dissemination of results to defined personnel/roles; and
- (f) Updates when significant changes occur.

The absence of a model card means there is no documented evidence that any of these activities have been performed. There is no record of identified threats or vulnerabilities, no likelihood/impact determinations, no documented review cadence, no dissemination plan, and no update policy. All sub-requirements of RA-3 are therefore unmet.
